<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Jan c/a surplus narrows to 0.7 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria Jan c/a surplus narrows to 0.7 bln ATS.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, April 3, Reuter - The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT	Jan 97     Jan 96</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  0.7 bln     6.3 bln</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -8.7 bln    -0.9 bln</p>
<p> Exports			   63.5 bln    68.8 bln</p>
<p> Imports			   72.2 bln    69.7 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparative data for December 1996 are not available.</p>
<p>For 1996 as a whole, Austria registered a current account deficit of 42.2 billion schillings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
